cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SEIQR Epidemic Cellular Automaton"
abstract: >-
  A stochastic 2D SEIQR cellular automaton modelling epidemic spread across a
  spatially heterogeneous population, with a vectorised simulation core, a
  reproducible experiment pipeline, an interactive Streamlit dashboard, and a
  validation of the model against the analytical mean-field SEIQR ODE. An
  individual extension of a UCL group computing project.
type: software
